  title: 'HP to Watts Calculator — Convert Horsepower to Watts & kW | Ampstowatt',
  metaDesc: 'Convert horsepower to watts and kilowatts. 1 electric HP = 746 W, mechanical = 745.7 W, metric = 735.5 W. Enter HP and type for an accurate conversion.',
