  lead: 'This <strong>HP to watts calculator</strong> converts horsepower to watts and kilowatts using the correct factor for your definition: electric (746 W), mechanical/imperial (745.7 W), or metric (735.5 W). Enter the horsepower and choose the type to get an exact power figure.',
  reviewed: 'September 5, 2026',
  featureList: ['Convert horsepower to watts and kilowatts', 'Electric, mechanical, and metric HP factors', 'Reverse watts-to-HP note included', 'Accurate to the correct HP definition'],
  methodology: 'The calculator multiplies horsepower by the conversion factor for the selected definition: electric horsepower = 746 W exactly, mechanical (imperial) horsepower = 745.699872 W (rounded 745.7), and metric horsepower (PS/CV) = 735.49875 W (rounded 735.5). Results are shown in watts and kilowatts, and the reverse (watts to horsepower) is watts ÷ factor.',
